          "role": "secondary",
          "content": "在曲奇下方漂浮的金色麦穗旁，融入三个轻量化3D质感标签，带有微弱的投影，与背景自然融合。"
        }
      ],
      "prompt": "Canvas and aspect ratio: Create a single 9:21 vertical image.\n\nReference image usage: Image 1 is the product identity reference. Infer the exact product appearance from Image 1 and keep the same product identity; do not redesign, invent, or over-describe the product from text.\n\nHuman reference usage: The Q-version 3D baker character should be a generic, friendly, stylized 3D cartoon character, not copying any specific brand mascot.\n\nOverall visual system: Warm and healing 3D miniature baking world. Palette of warm caramel, rich chocolate brown, warm oat milk white, and light cocoa gold. Soft side-backlight and gentle volumetric light. Miniature 3D baking workshop space with depth of field, featuring floating chocolate chips and golden wheat ears. Materials show crispy porous cookie texture and semi-melted glossy chocolate chips.\n\nCurrent viewport: Slice 01, establishing the product identity and core emotional appeal.\n\nModule role: Hero module acting as the main visual hook.\n\nScreen job and evidence: Introduce the product and its core benefit through a stunning hero visual and 3 key benefit tags.\n\nLayout intent: Immersive full-bleed 3D scene with a floating central product and integrated floating labels.\n\nFlexible page composition: High-impact, medium-density layout. A giant cookie based on Image 1 floats in the center as the primary visual focus. A small Q-version baker is positioned next to it. Three floating 3D-textured tags are placed below the cookie, integrated naturally into the environment.\n\nPrimary module: A giant crispy chocolate cookie based on the product from Image 1 floats in the center of a warm 3D miniature baking workshop. The cookie has a highly detailed, crispy, porous texture with semi-melted chocolate chips glistening under warm side-backlight. A cute, friendly Q-version 3D baker character stands next to the cookie, making a welcoming gesture.\n\nSecondary modules: Three small, floating 3D-textured rounded tags with soft drop shadows float near the bottom, surrounded by floating chocolate chips and golden wheat ears.\n\nChinese typography: Use a rounded, friendly, modern Chinese sans-serif font style. Keep text clean and legible.\nvisible Chinese headline: \"趣脆登场，一口爆浆\"\nvisible Chinese subheadline: \"浓郁黑巧与酥脆曲奇的梦幻碰撞\"\nvisible Chinese tags: \"浓郁黑巧\", \"酥脆麦香\", \"手工感烘焙\"\n\nEdge safety: Keep the top 10% as a warm oat milk white transition zone. Keep the bottom 15% clear of text, filled with floating chocolate chips and golden wheat ears to guide the eye downward.\n\nComposition notes: Centralized composition with dynamic depth of field. Warm, inviting lighting creates a soft glow around the cookie.\n\nImportant constraints: All visible text must be in Simplified Chinese. No English titles, no garbled text. Do not redesign the product from Image 1.\n\nTypography consistency: Maintain a consistent, friendly, rounded sans-serif font style.",
      "transition_in": "顶部10%留出温润燕麦乳白过渡区，轻盈可可金渐变融入",
