      ],
      "prompt": "Canvas and aspect ratio: Create a single 9:21 vertical image.\n\nReference image usage: Image 1 is the product identity reference. Infer the exact product appearance from Image 1 and keep the same product identity; do not redesign, invent, or over-describe the product from text.\n\nOverall visual system: Warm, healing, fairytale-like 3D miniature baking world. Palette of warm caramel, rich chocolate brown, warm oat milk white, and light cocoa gold. Warm soft side-backlight and soft volume light. 3D cartoon style.\n\nCurrent viewport: Slice 03. Show the gold quality of selected raw ingredients and handmade baking feel to resolve concerns about cheap ingredients.\n\nModule role: Function module with high information density, using a primary workshop scene and two secondary detail windows.\n\nScreen job and evidence: Demonstrate raw material quality using a 3D miniature workshop scene combined with dual macro detail windows as evidence.\n\nLayout intent: High-density page composition. 1 primary module (55% area) at the top/center, and 2 secondary detail windows (20% area each) arranged below.\n\nPrimary module: In a 3D miniature baking workshop, a cute Q-version 3D baker character is putting golden wheat ears and large chocolate blocks into a stone mill. Warm side-backlight illuminates floating oat milk white flour and cocoa powder particles in the air.\n\nSecondary modules:\n- Detail Window 1: A macro close-up of a plump imported cocoa bean surrounded by shiny, silky chocolate sauce.\n- Detail Window 2: A macro close-up of a golden wheat ear surrounded by porous, fluffy wheat flour.\n\nChinese typography: Use rounded, friendly modern sans-serif Chinese font style, clean and stable stroke weights, maximum 3 levels of hierarchy, left-aligned or centered.\nvisible Chinese headline: \"每一口，都是手作的温度\"\nvisible Chinese subheadline: \"精选纯可可脂与阳光小麦，还原烘焙坊现烤风味\"\nvisible Chinese tags: \"纯可可脂\" \"阳光麦粉\" \"匠心手作\"\nvisible Chinese detail label 1: \"纯可可脂巧克力\" \"浓郁丝滑不甜腻\"\nvisible Chinese detail label 2: \"阳光小麦粉\" \"麦香浓郁更酥脆\"\n\nEdge safety: Top 15% transitions from warm caramel to warm oat milk white with floating chocolate chips. Bottom 15% features slanted golden wheat ears and chocolate crumbs guiding the eye downwards. Keep important text and subjects away from edges.\n\nComposition notes: High-density layout, clear visual hierarchy. The primary workshop scene is the main focus, while the two detail windows are smaller, clean, and visually subordinate.\n\nImportant constraints: All visible text must be in Simplified Chinese. No English text, no garbled text. Do not redesign the product from Image 1. No cold tones, no flat minimalist layouts.",
