      "prompt": "Canvas and aspect ratio: Create a single 9:21 vertical image.\n\nReference image usage: Use Image 1 as the product identity reference; infer the exact product appearance from Image 1 and keep the same product identity; do not redesign, invent, or over-describe the product from text.\n\nOverall visual system: A warm, healing, and whimsical 3D miniature baking world. The color palette consists of warm caramel, rich chocolate brown, warm oat-milk white, and light cocoa gold. Illuminated by warm, soft side-backlight that creates glowing edge highlights and volumetric light. The background is a 3D cartoon-style baking workshop with depth-of-field blurred floating chocolate chips and golden wheat ears.\n\nCurrent viewport: Slice 05. A high-density detail showcase focusing on the baking quality and the crispy, porous texture of the cookie.\n\nLayout intent: A central primary visual featuring a split cookie cutaway, accompanied by two smaller, circular micro-zoom detail callout windows floating on the sides.\n\nFlexible page composition: High information density. The primary module occupies the upper-middle area, while two secondary detail bubbles float in the lower-middle area, creating a balanced, non-grid composition.\n\nPrimary module: A giant 3D cookie based on Image 1, gently split in half to reveal a highly detailed, porous, and crispy oat cookie texture inside, embedded with semi-melted, glossy chocolate chunks. A cute, miniature Q-version 3D baker character stands next to it in amazement.\n\nSecondary modules: \n- Detail Callout 1: A floating circular bubble window showing a micro close-up of the cookie's surface, highlighting the golden oat fibers and airy, porous breathing structure.\n- Detail Callout 2: A floating circular bubble window showing a micro close-up of the chocolate chips, highlighting the rich, semi-melted texture of high-purity cocoa butter chocolate.\n\nChinese typography: Use a clean, rounded modern Chinese sans-serif font. No calligraphy, no serif, no heavy shadows. \nvisible Chinese headline: \"多重控温烘焙，锁住浓郁麦香\"\nvisible Chinese subheadline: \"慢火细烤，成就每一口的蓬松酥脆\"\nvisible Chinese tags: \"空气感酥脆\", \"大颗真料\"\n\nEdge safety: Keep all text and key subjects away from the top and bottom 15% edges. The top edge transitions smoothly with a chocolate flow, and the bottom edge features scattered 3D chocolate chips and wheat ears.\n\nComposition notes: Warm, appetizing, and highly tactile. Use shallow depth of field to emphasize the cookie's texture.",
